{"4176490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mystery Phantoms: Ghostly Secrets Collector's Edition", "steam_appid": 4176490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4180200], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176490/extras/f08ff6707d8b9a412f75cb1e98036397.avif?t=1779804137\" width=1200 height=460 /></span><br>This is a Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure — a story-driven experience where exploration and brain-teasing challenges go hand in hand. In each location, you’ll carefully search detailed scenes to uncover cleverly concealed items, gather crucial clues, and solve a variety of mini-games and logic puzzles that push the investigation forward. It’s a perfect genre for players who enjoy immersive storytelling, sharp-eyed observation, and satisfying problem-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176490/extras/9daeb9b076316399d11c3894a0ab1535.poster.avif?t=1779804137\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176490/extras/9daeb9b076316399d11c3894a0ab1535.webm?t=1779804137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176490/extras/9daeb9b076316399d11c3894a0ab1535.mp4?t=1779804137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Riley Morto, an investigator drawn to places others fear to enter: abandoned mansions, desolate motels, forgotten asylums, and even a seemingly ordinary school hiding something sinister. Each case pulls you deeper into the unknown, where restless spirits linger and reality feels dangerously fragile. As you document your findings and piece together the past, you’ll uncover secrets that refuse to stay buried — and learn that some mysteries are far more than they appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176490/extras/b424ac6ecd2e8e624525104497e6d6f5.poster.avif?t=1779804137\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176490/extras/b424ac6ecd2e8e624525104497e6d6f5.webm?t=1779804137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176490/extras/b424ac6ecd2e8e624525104497e6d6f5.mp4?t=1779804137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a thrilling collection of challenges, from classic hidden object scenes to inventive mini-games that test your logic and attention to detail. Every new location brings fresh surprises, eerie atmosphere, and puzzles to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176490/extras/8ac6fba85b9afcc0a1a28766bcfded02.poster.avif?t=1779804137\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176490/extras/8ac6fba85b9afcc0a1a28766bcfded02.webm?t=1779804137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176490/extras/8ac6fba85b9afcc0a1a28766bcfded02.mp4?t=1779804137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👻 Explore richly detailed, interactive environments filled with clues</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👻 Solve dozens of challenging puzzles and mini-games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👻 Confront supernatural manifestations that distort reality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👻 Search for a wide variety of hidden objects and collectibles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👻 Make choices that influence what remains after the spirits fade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👻 Unlock achievements that prove your investigative skill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👻 Access bonus content including soundtrack tracks, wallpapers, and more<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176490/extras/4753d14e432e86bd5a4bfefdb66b0d0d.poster.avif?t=1779804137\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176490/extras/4753d14e432e86bd5a4bfefdb66b0d0d.webm?t=1779804137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176490/extras/4753d14e432e86bd5a4bfefdb66b0d0d.mp4?t=1779804137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step beyond the veil, trust your instincts, and uncover the truth, before the truth finds you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176490/extras/f08ff6707d8b9a412f75cb1e98036397.avif?t=1779804137\" width=1200 height=460 /></span><br>This is a Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure — a story-driven experience where exploration and brain-teasing challenges go hand in hand. In each location, you’ll carefully search detailed scenes to uncover cleverly concealed items, gather crucial clues, and solve a variety of mini-games and logic puzzles that push the investigation forward. It’s a perfect genre for players who enjoy immersive storytelling, sharp-eyed observation, and satisfying problem-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.ste